MilkDAWp patch to projectM (ADR-0012, Phase 8.7): projectm_set_preset_variable().
Writes externally controlled variables (e.g. mdw_m1) into the active preset(s)'
per-frame and per-vertex expression contexts before the per-frame code runs on
every frame. Not submitted upstream (2026-10-05); re-apply on every projectM bump.
Modifies LGPL-2.1-only projectM sources, so this patch is LGPL-2.1-only too.

